From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm: dts: add Polaris ABL framebuffer for U-Boot

Use the SDM845 downstream splash reservation and Polaris panel geometry
for U-Boot video/EFI GOP. Keep this in a U-Boot-only DTS include; the Linux
DT and display driver remain independent.

References (hardware data, not an imported patch):
https://github.com/edk2-porting/edk2-sdm845/blob/e1952621f419f8db60ed28271264e1b5184c571d/Platform/Xiaomi/sdm845/polaris.dsc
https://github.com/edk2-porting/edk2-sdm845/blob/e1952621f419f8db60ed28271264e1b5184c571d/Platform/Qualcomm/sdm845/sdm845.dsc
Downstream SDM845 cont_splash_region: 0x9d400000, size 0x02400000.

Signed-off-by: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
---
diff --git a/arch/arm/dts/sdm845-xiaomi-polaris-u-boot.dtsi b/arch/arm/dts/sdm845-xiaomi-polaris-u-boot.dtsi
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..1d0028be
--- /dev/null
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/sdm845-xiaomi-polaris-u-boot.dtsi
@@ -0,0 +1,26 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0+
+
+/* ABL leaves the display scanning out of the downstream splash reservation. */
+/ {
+	chosen {
+		#address-cells = <2>;
+		#size-cells = <2>;
+		ranges;
+
+		framebuffer@9d400000 {
+			compatible = "simple-framebuffer";
+			reg = <0 0x9d400000 0 0x02400000>;
+			width = <1080>;
+			height = <2160>;
+			stride = <4320>;
+			format = "a8r8g8b8";
+		};
+	};
+
+	reserved-memory {
+		framebuffer_mem: memory@9d400000 {
+			reg = <0 0x9d400000 0 0x02400000>;
+			no-map;
+		};
+	};
+};
